<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Fortune Cement says H1 net 57 pct up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fortune Cement says H1 net 57 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Net Sales		  748.4 vs 530.5</p>
<p>    Net income		 285.6 vs 181.6</p>
<p>Note: Full name Fortune Cement Corp. The company is a member of the SM group of companies owned by Filipino-Chinese department store tycoon Henry Sy.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8939 Fax 817--6267</p>
</text>
